<title>CHILE: Chile's Banco BHIF signs $80 mln syndicated loan.</title>
<headline>Chile's Banco BHIF signs $80 mln syndicated loan.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Banco BHIF said it has signed an $80 million syndicated loan with a group of foriegn banks, with Deutsche Bank Luxembourg SA acting as agent for the deal.</p>
<p>The loan is for five years at an interest rate of LIBOR plus 0.3 percent, said the bank in a statement.</p>
<p>Joint arrangers of the loan included Barclays Bank Plc, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell-Kredietbank and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
